<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select rib and loin cuts firm, while round cuts weak. Choice chuck and round cuts firm, while loin cutshigher.  Beef trimmings firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
